rc=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\">Daze</a> them. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rush_Attack\" title=\"Rush Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Rush_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp/60px-Rush_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp/80px-Rush_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rush Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Rush_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rush_Attack\" title=\"Rush Attack\">Rush Attack</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Charge forward and attack the first enemy in your way, possibly pushing them <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Off_Balance_(Condition)\" title=\"Off Balance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Off Balance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Off_Balance_(Condition)\" title=\"Off Balance (Condition)\">Off Balance</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Campsite_(Act_One)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Campsite (Act One)\">Campsite (Act One)</a>: Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kith%27rak_Voss\" title=\"Kith'rak Voss\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png/25px-Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png/38px-Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png/50px-Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Kith'rak Voss\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png/25px-Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Portrait_Kith%27rak_Voss.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Kith%27rak_Voss\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kith'rak Voss\">Kith'rak Voss</a> during his visit to camp in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress\" title=\"Sharess' Caress\">Sharess' Caress</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;25&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;98</span>: Carried by Voss on the first floor in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City_Sewers\" title=\"Lower City Sewers\">Lower City Sewers</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-70&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;826</span>: Carried by Voss in Act Three</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Upper_City\" title=\"Upper City\">Upper City</a>: Looted from Voss, if he is killed at the end of Act Three</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Prior to Patch 6 it could be purchased from Voss during Act 3, but this is no longer the case.</li>\n<li>The sword can be pickpocketed from Voss (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;26 Sleight of Hand Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;26 <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a>) as early as right before the conversation with Raphael by a stealthy character buffed with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Invisibility\" title=\"Greater Invisibility\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp/20px-Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp/30px-Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp/40px-Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Greater Invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp/20px-Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Greater_Invisibility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Invisibility\" title=\"Greater Invisibility\">Greater Invisibility</a>, followed by teleportation to camp.</li></ul>\n\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Interplanar Slayer:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Interplanar Slayer does not add the 1d4 bonus to attack rolls, though the damage bonus does apply to attacks made only with this weapon.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 302px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 300px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Voss%27_Silver_Sword_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Appearance in game\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Voss%27_Silver_Sword_ingame.png/450px-Voss%27_Silver_Sword_ingame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Voss%27_Silver_Sword_ingame.png/675px-Voss%27_Silver_Sword_ingame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d7/Voss%27_Silver_Sword_ingame.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Appearance in game\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Voss%27_Silver_Sword_ingame.png/450px-Voss%27_Silver_Sword_ingame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Voss%27_Silver_Sword_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Appearance in game</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit rep